inspect the project configuration

Usage:
  treerig config [flags]
  treerig config [command]

Available Commands:
  validate    parse and validate treerig.toml
  show        print the resolved configuration as JSON
  schema      print the JSON Schema of treerig.toml

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for config

Global Flags:
      --config string   path to treerig.toml (default: nearest above cwd)
  -V, --version         output the version number

Use "treerig config [command] --help" for more information about a command.
